'''Lyana Hazard''' was a [[human]] who resided in the [[Pabu island|remote island]] on [[Pabu]] along with her [[Parent|father]], [[Shep Hazard]].<ref name="Pabu" />

==Personality and traits==
Lyana Hazard was a young female [[human]] with [[Color|brown]] [[hair]], brown [[eye]]s, and brown skin. She wore a white undershirt with a red, sleeveless shirt over it. She also had a necklace.<ref name="Pabu" />

Lyana was friendly and took an immediate liking to [[Omega]], showing her around the remote island, inviting her on their boat to watch the sunset, and empathetically listening when Omega spoke about leaving her [[Kamino|homeworld]]. She had a close relationship with [[Phee Genoa]], whom she called Auntie Phee, and took interest in the artifacts that Genoa discovered.<ref name="Pabu" />

